<section class="section-band py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-16">
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll chip mb-6">
        <span class="mini-label">Who it is for</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="reveal-on-scroll section-title">
        Built for growing stores, not generic websites.
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal-on-scroll mt-6 section-copy text-center">
        VoluChat is not for everyone. It is an operations layer built specifically for brands that have traction but are bottlenecked by manual work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll solid-card reveal-delay-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Growing Shopify Stores</h3>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          You have a catalog of products and steady traffic, but you are losing money to abandoned carts and missed follow-ups.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-on-scroll solid-card reveal-delay-200">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">D2C Brands</h3>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          You want to clear old stock, push specific bundles, and increase LTV without manually writing emails for every small segment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-on-scroll solid-card reveal-delay-300">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Ecommerce Teams</h3>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Your customer support team is spending 80% of their day answering "Where is my order?" or "Do you have this in large?"
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
